758
00:50:40.671 --> 00:50:43.239
Sophie, one way or another,
I'm coming inside.

759
00:50:55.418 --> 00:50:56.452
Hi.

760
00:50:57.287 --> 00:50:58.288
Evening.

761
00:50:59.088 --> 00:51:00.691
Like I said,
it was just a mistake.

762
00:51:02.091 --> 00:51:03.126
Okay.

763
00:51:04.595 --> 00:51:05.995
